# CLI build output
cli/dist/

# supabase/migrations/ is VERSIONED IN FULL — do not add a blanket ignore here.
#
# A blanket `supabase/migrations/*` with per-file `!` negations lived here until
# 2026-09-05. The negations stopped at 085, so 086 and 087 were never committed even
# though live dashboard routes call an RPC defined only in 086 — and 73 earlier
# migrations were untracked too. CI runs `supabase db push` on a fresh checkout, so the
# schema could only be reproduced from a developer's laptop. Removed in Phase 0 of the
# paycraft-dashboard-paywall-parity epic; a prod probe at the time confirmed all 84 were
# applied, so this was a reproducibility defect rather than a live schema gap.
#
# The convenience symlink case this ignore was originally written for (a local dev
# pointing supabase/migrations → ../server/migrations so `supabase db reset` finds them)
# belongs in supabase/.gitignore, which already covers .temp and .branches.
.vercel

# Wrangler CLI cache (Cloudflare Workers)
.wrangler/

# Materialized secrets — RULE-SECRETS-VAULT-001 (SV18/SV32).
# These are `/secrets pull` outputs, never source. Committing one is a leak that
# survives deletion and forces a rotation.
secrets.local.json
secrets.local.toml
**/secrets.local.json
**/secrets.local.toml

# Local CI scratch marker (not source).
__ci_only__
